{"name":"San Marino","slug":"san-marino","code":"SM","continent":"Europe","hero":"plonkit/san-marino/Bild_2022-07-01_135104582.webp","updated":"2024-08-06T00:00:00.000Z","sections":[{"title":"Identifying San Marino","title_zh":"辨識聖馬利諾","items":[{"id":"nbvK","text":["The 739m-tall **Monte Titano** dominates the surrounding landscape and is visible from almost every point in the Republic.","NOTE: Look for the **three towers** to safely identify it."],"text_zh":[],"image":"plonkit/san-marino/San_Marino_Monte_Titano.webp","link":"https://maps.app.goo.gl/vUPiUkLWrGB1KzXC8","clues":["scenery"],"important":false,"tagged":false},{"id":"Fpf0","text":["The landscape of San Marino largely consists of smooth **agricultural hills**, with many small winding roads. The vegetation is distinctly **Mediterranean**, and normally appears quite lush."],"text_zh":[],"image":"plonkit/san-marino/San_Marino_Landscape.webp","link":"https://maps.app.goo.gl/1cqVe47FmXH9gp6bA","clues":["nature","scenery"],"important":false,"tagged":false},{"id":"B9B0","text":["Sammarinese licence plates are **short**, **white** and have **blue lettering** on them.","NOTE: Other European countries will typically have **longer** licence plates, often with one or more **blue strips**."],"text_zh":[],"image":"plonkit/san-marino/San_Marino_License_Plate.webp","link":"","clues":["license_plates"],"important":false,"tagged":false},{"id":"9e8C","text":["Road signs and bollards are **generally identical** to the ones used in Italy.","NOTE: Many road signs give directions to the nearby Italian city of **Rimini**."],"text_zh":[],"image":"plonkit/san-marino/San_Marino_Italian_infrastructure.webp","link":"https://maps.app.goo.gl/5VD2pzJLT1RXj8PCA","clues":["bollards","signs"],"important":false,"tagged":true},{"id":"8OjL","text":["Just like Italy, most utility poles in San Marino are **round **and made** **of **concrete. **Wooden poles are also found in the country."],"text_zh":[],"image":"plonkit/san-marino/San_Marino_Poles.webp","link":"https://maps.app.goo.gl/we7AJ1yxXcfgqLLz9","clues":["utility_poles"],"important":false,"tagged":true},{"id":"XqN5","text":["San Marino is the only country in the world to use **yellow **chevrons with **burgundy red **arrows."],"text_zh":[],"image":"plonkit/san-marino/San_Marino_Chevron.webp","link":"https://maps.app.goo.gl/bM4E51AfrGfBSFaX8","clues":["chevrons"],"important":false,"tagged":false},{"id":"RCBb","text":["These **elaborate pedestrian crossings**, with painted blue crosswalks and hanging signs, are specific to San Marino."],"text_zh":[],"image":"plonkit/san-marino/San_Marino_Pedestrian_Crossing.webp","link":"https://maps.app.goo.gl/JNpdbvUsjLXyrEuW8","clues":["signs"],"important":false,"tagged":false},{"id":"HAjS","text":["**Lime-green bins** are particularly common in San Marino. In Generation 4 coverage some of them have been replaced by **black **bins."],"text_zh":[],"image":"plonkit/san-marino/San_Marino_Trash_Bins.webp","link":"https://maps.app.goo.gl/Jr3mAXsrTXH3BojV7","clues":[],"important":false,"tagged":false}]},{"title":"Regional clues","title_zh":"區域性線索","items":[{"id":"7HE9","text":["The Superstrada di San Marino runs from the border village of Dogana to the City of San Marino. It is the **only divided road** in the country, and the lanes are separated by a **metal guardrail**."],"text_zh":[],"image":"plonkit/san-marino/San_Marino_divided_road.webp","link":"https://maps.app.goo.gl/i8B3TJE5iChF9pWt8","clues":["guardrails"],"important":false,"tagged":true}]},{"title":"Spotlight","title_zh":"重點地標","items":[{"id":"nInM","text":["The **historic centre** is covered by a Generation 3 trekker camera."],"text_zh":[],"image":"plonkit/san-marino/Historic_Centre_Trekker.webp","link":"https://goo.gl/maps/gyyhejECLchJdGQs5","clues":["google_vehicles"],"important":false,"tagged":false}]}],"tip_count":10,"facts":{"driving_side":"right","phone_numbers":"+39 (0549)","domains":[".sm"],"currencies":[{"name":"Euro","symbol":"€","status":"official","code":"EUR"}],"years":["2012","2013","2015","2016","2017","2018","2019","2020","2021","2022","2023","2024","2025"],"lines":[["white"],["white"],["white"]]},"gallery":{"bollards":[{"image":"geohints/bollards/bollard_162.webp","link":"https://maps.app.goo.gl/6n7c9JBhaBdk8AXG9"},{"image":"geohints/bollards/bollard_398.webp","link":"https://goo.gl/maps/Rc1TGtfmdaUpBCVu8"},{"image":"geohints/bollards/bollard_17.webp","link":"https://maps.app.goo.gl/EJAc1MF9VoFodMhi8"},{"image":"geohints/bollards/bollard_21.webp","link":"https://maps.app.goo.gl/NZcxQFSLogUo933C7"},{"image":"geohints/bollards/bollard_889.webp","link":"https://maps.app.goo.gl/GPtfNjsmYNFEZnpC9"}],"companies":[{"image":"geohints/companies/companies_238.svg","link":"https://maps.app.goo.gl/ceF9PouVE4683pxG7"},{"image":"geohints/companies/companies_1185.svg","link":"https://maps.app.goo.gl/1nyHiTN1ym79sYB57"}],"gas_stations":[{"image":"geohints/companies/companies_1094.svg","link":"https://maps.app.goo.gl/aKwPpZAK9xsBScdy6"}],"flags":[{"image":"geohints/flags/flags_98.svg","link":""}],"google_vehicles":[{"image":"geohints/googleVehicles/car_952.webp","link":"https://maps.app.goo.gl/fRHD3u5kPtF2cnuR9"},{"image":"geohints/googleVehicles/car_953.webp","link":"https://maps.app.goo.gl/oGT6ECPHPyvQai4S6"}],"license_plates":[{"image":"geohints/licensePlates/San_Marino.webp","link":""}],"post_boxes":[{"image":"geohints/post_boxes/san_marino_1.webp","link":"https://goo.gl/maps/6YvKE6cEdKYTg5oF6"}],"scenery":[{"image":"geohints/sceneries/san_marino_1.webp","link":"https://goo.gl/maps/DGeqGvZxQFoorZ8d6"},{"image":"geohints/sceneries/san_marino_2.webp","link":"https://goo.gl/maps/RXD7BKW4TdDCatur6"},{"image":"geohints/sceneries/san_marino_3.webp","link":"https://goo.gl/maps/PCWTCuuBaRHekXPT9"}],"utility_poles":[{"image":"geohints/utilityPoles/pole_327.webp","link":"https://maps.app.goo.gl/pCh6sVjDVXirrpzC6"},{"image":"geohints/utilityPoles/pole_328.webp","link":"https://maps.app.goo.gl/CQfFRX1nnEAMe5UV7"},{"image":"geohin